  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1502.39 Meadow buffer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1502.39 “Meadow buffer” means a land area that has a dense cover of tall grasses or a combination of grasses and shrubs or trees, that is maintained as a meadow.\n\nSource. #9343, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12342, eff 8-15-17 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.36); ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.40); renumbered by #14656, eff 8-6-26, EXPIRES: 8-6-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.38)",
